[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4514.99, "timestamp": "01:15:14", "text": "自從我們第一次交談以來，你就一直是個異類。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4524.07, "timestamp": "01:15:24", "text": "不用擔心。返校課程對象為所有入學學生。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4526.629, "timestamp": "01:15:26", "text": "揭露人們試圖忽視的過去和真實感受。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4528.629, "timestamp": "01:15:28", "text": "我知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4554.39, "timestamp": "01:15:54", "text": "20"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4556.877, "timestamp": "01:15:56", "text": "在我十歲之前，我就憑藉自己的能力閱讀了唱片。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4558.35, "timestamp": "01:15:58", "text": "[音樂]"}]